## Quick Reference Card

### Margin Shortcuts

```
+good     +well      +example
?unclear  ?source    ?check    ?meaning
~link
```

### Common Patterns

| Issue | Quick Response |
|-------|----------------|
| No references | sm-004 (referencing pattern) |
| Too descriptive | sm-005 (critical thinking) |
| Unclear structure | sm-003 (structure) |
| Good but shallow | sm-002 (depth) |
| Shows improvement | sm-007 (encouragement) |

